  "articleBody": "Before requesting proposals for a bedroom addition, define how the room will be used, gather property information, and ask each provider to explain design, permit, construction, and inspection responsibilities. Comparing complete scopes rather than headline prices helps reveal differences in structural work, finishes, utility changes, and project coordination.",
